    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "estimated_duration_s": 12,
      "narration_text": "This is Liam, in for Bear. Send one qubit and recover two classical bits. The catch is essential: Alice and Bob must already share entanglement. Superdense coding spends that shared resource.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "CARD",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "type",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "ClaudeComposerAsk",
          "props": {
            "command": "Account for every resource in superdense coding.",
            "topic": "QUANTUM MECHANICS — COMMUNICATION",
            "segment": "One Qubit, Two Bits",
            "greeting": "Bonjour, Liam",
            "runningText": "tracking the qubit and shared ebit…",
            "output": [
              "Before: Alice and Bob share one Bell pair.",
              "During: Alice transmits one physical qubit."
            ],
            "folderLabel": "@NikBearBrown",
            "modelLabel": "Claude",
            "effortLabel": "High"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B01.mp4",
            "at": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B01.mp3",
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B01.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-07-18T23:04:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "estimated_duration_s": 10,
      "narration_text": "Begin with Bell state phi plus. Alice holds qubit A, Bob holds qubit B. Neither local qubit alone contains the two-bit message.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "split"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim/B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim",
        "at": "2026-07-18T23:04:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "estimated_duration_s": 11,
      "narration_text": "Alice chooses message zero-zero, zero-one, one-zero, or one-one. She encodes it by applying one of four local operations: I, Z, X, or XZ.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "branch"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3",
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim/B03.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim",
        "at": "2026-07-18T23:04:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "estimated_duration_s": 11,
      "narration_text": "Those four operations transform the shared pair into four orthogonal Bell states: phi plus, phi minus, psi plus, and psi minus, up to an irrelevant global phase.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "accumulate"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B04.mp3",
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim/B04.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim",
        "at": "2026-07-18T23:04:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "estimated_duration_s": 10,
      "narration_text": "Alice has changed only her half, yet the information is encoded in the joint two-qubit state. Bob still cannot read it while the qubits are separated.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "compare"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B05.mp3",
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim/B05.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim",
        "at": "2026-07-18T23:04:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "estimated_duration_s": 10,
      "narration_text": "Alice now sends her one physical qubit to Bob through the quantum channel. This transmission is the causal step; entanglement alone carried no message.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "transform"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B06.mp3",
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim/B06.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim",
        "at": "2026-07-18T23:04:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "estimated_duration_s": 11,
      "narration_text": "Bob now holds both qubits. A Bell-basis measurement can distinguish the four orthogonal joint states perfectly in the ideal protocol.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "collapse"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B07.mp3",
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim/B07.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim",
        "at": "2026-07-18T23:04:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B08",
      "estimated_duration_s": 10,
      "narration_text": "Phi plus decodes zero-zero, phi minus zero-one, psi plus one-zero, and psi minus one-one, using our chosen convention.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "compare"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B08.mp3",
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim/B08.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim",
        "at": "2026-07-18T23:04:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B09",
      "estimated_duration_s": 12,
      "narration_text": "The honest resource statement is two classical bits communicated by one transmitted qubit plus one previously shared entangled pair. It is not two bits stored in an isolated qubit.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "threshold"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B09.mp3",
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim/B09.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim",
        "at": "2026-07-18T23:04:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B10",
      "estimated_duration_s": 11,
      "narration_text": "There is no faster-than-light signaling. Before Alice's qubit arrives, Bob's local state is unchanged and reveals nothing about which operation she chose.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "collapse"
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B10.mp3",
      "build": {
        "status": "MANIM",
        "src": "manim/B10.mp4",
        "filled_by": "manim",
        "at": "2026-07-18T23:04:03"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B11",
      "estimated_duration_s": 12,
      "narration_text": "Your turn. Alice applies X, then sends her qubit. Which Bell state and which message does Bob decode in this convention? Pause before the answer: psi plus, message one-zero.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "CARD",
        "source": "remotion",
        "motion": "type",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "ClaudeComposerAsk",
          "props": {
            "command": "Your turn: decode Alice's X operation.",
            "topic": "QUANTUM MECHANICS — CHECK",
            "segment": "Bell-State Address",
            "greeting": "Your move, Liam",
            "runningText": "waiting for the Bell-state label…",
            "output": [
              "X on Alice's half: |Psi+>.",
              "Decoded classical message: 10."
            ],
            "folderLabel": "@NikBearBrown",
            "modelLabel": "Claude",
            "effortLabel": "High"
          },
          "rendered": {
